      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Injury blow",
          "heading": "Thibaud Flament faces several weeks out with shoulder injury before Springboks test",
          "body": "Les Bleus have lost another second-row option. Toulouse lock Thibaud Flament is facing several weeks on the sidelines with a shoulder injury, according to L'Équipe. The 29-year-old was tipped to pair up in the second row for the Tests against Fiji, the Springboks and Argentina, and Emmanuel Meafou is already expected to miss out with a knee injury. Fabien Galthié is now short of engine-room options before the Springboks test in Paris, against a world champion pack."
        },
