    "388": {
      "date": "2026-10-18",
      "edition": "Sunday 18 October",
      "sections": [
        {
          "kicker": "Rivalry revisited",
          "heading": "Kitshoff backs Etzebeth's claim Irish acted arrogantly after 2023 Dublin match",
          "body": "Steven Kitshoff, promoting his memoir Kitsie, has backed Eben Etzebeth's claim that the Irish reacted arrogantly towards the Springboks after the 2023 World Cup pool match in Dublin. The retired prop also recalls South Africa's rivalry with Ireland flaring after a 2017 loss in Dublin, and says the Springboks tend to make slights \"extremely personal\". It is a reminder that the grudge runs both ways, and that Ireland's meetings with South Africa carry memories on both sides."
        },
