          "kicker": "Last meeting",
          "heading": "Italy lost 32-14 to South Africa at home in November 2025",
          "body": "South Africa are Italy's next opponent, in Round 4 of the Nations Championship, and the last meeting between the sides ended 32-14 to the Springboks. That was an International Friendlies match at home in November 2025, a single result rather than a wider record. Italy have lost all three Nations Championship matches so far, scoring 37 points and conceding 131."
