          "kicker": "World Cup bid",
          "heading": "Argentina lead four-nation South American bid to host 2035 Rugby World Cup",
          "body": "Argentina are one of four South American nations, alongside Uruguay, Chile and Brazil, who have submitted a joint bid to host the 2035 Rugby World Cup, News24 reported in early October. Planet Rugby frames the bid as a challenge to World Rugby's desire for a European return, while another report, from Yahoo Sports, names Spain as front-runner. World Rugby has yet to announce a successful bid, so the decision remains open."
        },
